# TEMPORARY (302): the secure document scanner moved to badmint (mg #708). Temporary
# because the badmint repo will later be served as badmin.robnugen.com itself.
# Every path goes to the page, so an old POST to name_item.php or confirm_item.php
# is not answered here.
RedirectMatch 302 ^/ai_secure/ https://badmint.robnugen.com/ai_secure/
